            {
              "text": "<p><b>STEP 4</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 2;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;After receipt of registration amount the applicant will receive an admission letter for applying student visa.</span></p>",
              "media": {
