              "size": 0
            }
          },
          "brand": "<a class=\"navbar-caption\" data-app-btn=\"true\" data-app-selector=\".navbar-caption\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Brand Name\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnRemove,mbrColor\">RKDF</a>",
          "items": "<li class=\"nav-item\"><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"nav-link link\" href=\"index.html\" aria-expanded=\"false\">HOME</a></li><li class=\"nav-item dropdown\"><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle\" href=\"https://mobirise.com/\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">INTERNATIONAL ADMISSION</a><div class=\"dropdown-menu\"><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"admissio.html\">ADMISSION PROCESS</a><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">PAYMENT PROCEDURE</a><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"rules.html\">ADMISSION RULES</a><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">COURSES &amp; FEE</a><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"faq.html\">FAQs</a></div></li><li class=\"nav-item dropdown open\"><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" href=\"https://mobirise.com/\" aria-expanded=\"true\">STUDENT INFORMATION</a><div class=\"dropdown-menu\"><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"https://mobirise.com/\">STUDENT NOTIFICATION</a><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"https://www.mnnit.ac.in/swo/files/MNNIT_Hostel_Rules.pdf\">HOSTEL RULES</a><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"FROFRRO.html\">FRO/FRRO</a></div></li><li class=\"nav-item dropdown\"><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" href=\"https://mobirise.com/\" aria-expanded=\"false\">HELP</a><div class=\"dropdown-menu\"><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"http://forums.mobirise.com/\">Forum</a><a data-app-btn=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"https://mobirise.com/\">Contact us</a></div></li><li class=\"nav-item nav-btn\"><a data-app-btn=\"true\" data-button=\"\" data-app-selector=\".btn\" class=\"nav-link btn btn-white btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobirise.com/\">DOWNLOAD</a></li>"
        },
        {
          "_inherit": "testimonials2",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "testimonials4",
          "_styles": {
            ".card-block P": {
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "testimonial": [
            {
              "text": "<p><b>1.0 General</b></p><p>The University agrees in principle to admit Foreign Nationals/NRI students to the Postgraduate, Undergraduate and Ph. D. programmes in different fields on full time basis to provide educational opportunities to Foreign Nationals/NRI students and thereby generate resources for funding the cost of education and development of facilities.</p>",
              "media": {
                "image": {
                  "src": "@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/face3.jpg",
                  "class": "img-circle",
                  "height": 160,
                  "width": 160,
                  "active": true
                }
              },
              "authorName": "",
              "authorBio": "User"
            },
            {
              "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 2;\"><b>2.0 Category of Foreign Nationals/NRI</b></span><br></p><p>Foreign Nationals /NRI students are categorized as follows</p><p>•\tSponsored by the Govt. of India (through ICCR) on cultural exchange programme</p><p>•\tSponsored by the home country of the concerned Foreign Nationals/NRI students and/or funding agencies</p><p>•\tSelf-financing direct entry (with the clearance of Govt. of India)</p><p>•\tNRI students</p>",
              "media": {
                "image": {
                  "src": "@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/face1.jpg",
                  "class": "img-circle",
                  "height": 160,
                  "width": 160,
                  "active": true
                }
              },
              "authorName": "",
              "authorBio": "User"
            },
            {
              "text": "<p><b>2.1 Qualification</b></p><p>The eligibility required for admission to different programmes can be checked in detail from the prospectus or University website. The minimum educational qualification for admission of Foreign Nationals/NRI in various programmes is same as for Indians. Only those students who have qualified from Foreign Universities or Boards of Higher Education, recognized as equivalent by the Association of Indian Universities (AIU) are eligible for admission. When required, a reference will be made to AIU to check the equivalent.</p>",
              "media": {
                "image": {
                  "src": "@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/face2.jpg",
                  "class": "img-circle",
                  "height": 160,
                  "width": 160,
                  "active": true
                }
              },
              "authorName": "",
              "authorBio": "User"
            },
            {
              "text": "<p><b>2.2 Requirement of Visa</b></p><p>All the Foreign Nationals/NRI students will require a student visa endorsed to only RKDF University for joining full time programmes. No other endorsement is acceptable. Students wishing to join a research programme will require a research visa endorsed to RKDF University. The visa should be valid for the prescribed duration of the course or for a maximum of five years. Study visa applications require an unconditional offer from a recognized Indian educational institute.</p>",
              "media": {
                "image": {
                  "src": "@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/face2.jpg",
                  "class": "img-circle",
                  "height": 160,
                  "width": 160,
                  "active": true
                }
              },
              "authorName": "",
              "authorBio": "Developer"
            },
            {
              "text": "<p><b>3.0 Admission</b></p><p><b>3.1 Admission Information</b></p><p>Student willing to join the University for various programmes will get the information about the application form, eligibility requirements, courses available and admission procedure from Eduzina.com or the website of the University.</p>",
              "media": {
                "image": {
                  "src": "@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/face2.jpg",
                  "class": "img-circle",
                  "height": 160,
                  "width": 160,
                  "active": true
                }
              },
              "authorName": "",
              "authorBio": "Developer"
            }
          ],
          "_anchor": "testimonials4-k",
          "_params": {
            "count": "5",
            "paddingTop": 3,
            "paddingBottom": "1",
            "showImages": false,
            "showName": true,
            "showBio": false,
            "bgImageRadio": false,
            "parallax": true,
            "bgImage": "@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/sky.jpg",
            "bgColor": "#00a885",
            "bgColorRadio": true,
            "overlay": true,
            "overlayOpacity": 0.2,
            "overlayColor": "#222",
            "showTitle": true,
            "showSubtitle": false
          },
          "title": "Admissions Rules",
          "subtitle": "Shape your future web project with sharp design and refine coded functions."
        },
        {
          "_inherit": "testimonials2",
          "_tags": [
            "Theme"
          ],
          "_name": "testimonials4",
          "_styles": {
            ".card-block P": {
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "testimonial": [
            {
              "text": "<p>1. X / SSC Marks Sheet / ‘O’ Level Certificate.</p><p>2. XII / HSSC / Intermediate Marks Sheet / ‘A’ Level Certificate</p><p>3. Leaving / Transfer Certificate</p><p>4. Graduation Mark Sheets</p><p>5. Migration Certificate*.</p><p>6. Photocopy of  Visa / Passport.</p>",
              "media": {
                "image": {
                  "src": "@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/face3.jpg",
                  "class": "img-circle",
                  "height": 160,
                  "width": 160,
                  "active": true
                }
              },
              "authorName": "Abanoub S.",
              "authorBio": "User"
            },
            {
              "text": "<p>•\tAfter checking applicant eligibility criteria, we will forward the consent approval with elaborated process on students’ email id.</p><p>•\tAfter receiving the approval of the application, the applicant has to deposit USD 500 towards registration and other formalities. For bank details click here.</p><p>•\tAfter receipt of registration amount the applicant will receive an admission letter for applying student visa.</p><p>•\tPersonal interview with verification along with the full fee deposition is the final step for the conversion of provisional admission into confirmed admission.</p><p><br></p>",
              "media": {
                "image": {
                  "src": "@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/face1.jpg",
                  "class": "img-circle",
                  "height": 160,
                  "width": 160,
                  "active": true
                }
              },
              "authorName": "Suffian A.",
              "authorBio": "User"
            },
            {
              "text": "<p><b>3.2 Final admission</b></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;After obtaining the provisional eligibility letter the following requirements have to be fulfilled:</p><p><b>3.2.1 Visa</b></p><p><b>3.2.2 Fee</b></p>",
              "media": {
                "image": {
                  "src": "@THEME_PATH@/components/_images/face2.jpg",
                  "class": "img-circle",
                  "height": 160,
                  "width": 160,
                  "active": true
                }
              },
              "authorName": "Jhollman C.",
              "authorBio": "User"
            }
          ],
          "_anchor": "testimonials4-l",
          "_params": {
            "count": "3",
            "paddingTop": "0",
